                                                "sense_id": "cc93658a-69e6-3e6f-a420-30e6612e1151",
                                                "text": "US-Gulf relations have improved significantly since Trump returned to office. Frustrated at the perceived lack of US interest in their needs under the Biden administration, Saudi Arabia and the UAE had sought to diversify their military, technological and economic ties."
